        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64259221?u=8318ebec4fc355797357a1c9a78f3f2daf238e55&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Changelog: <a href=\"https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/-/releases/1.5.84\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/-/releases/1.5.84</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated finalAttrs.version from <code class=\"notranslate\">1.4.9</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">1.5.84</code> and the hashes accordingly,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Renamed meson option <code class=\"notranslate\">systemd</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">libsystemd</code> to match upstream changes,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Disabled meson option <code class=\"notranslate\">bluez5-codec-ldac-dec</code>(not previously enabled, requires separate library; <code class=\"notranslate\">libldac</code>),</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Disabled meson option <code class=\"notranslate\">bluez5-plc-spandsp</code>(not previously enabled, however, <code class=\"notranslate\">spandsp</code> is in nixpkgs but wasn't used before),</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Disabled meson option <code class=\"notranslate\">onnxruntime</code> (not previously enabled)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tested with:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/pipewire --version</code> (\"Compiled with libpipewire 1.5.84 Linked with libpipewire 1.5.84\")</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">nix-build --attr pipewire.passthru.tests</code> passed 23/24.<br>\nThe failing test <code class=\"notranslate\">spa-benchmark-aec.test</code> requires sample files. Debian also skips this test (1.5.81). Should it be disabled in Nix as well?</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Built on platform:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tested, as applicable:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"h